{
  "name": "MessageHub - yCloud WhatsApp to Firebase",
  "blueprint": {
    "version": 1,
    "scheduling": {
      "type": "indefinitely"
    },
    "modules": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
        "version": 1,
        "parameters": {
          "hook": {
            "label": "yCloud Inbound Webhook",
            "type": "hook"
          },
          "maxResults": 1
        },
        "mapper": {},
        "metadata": {
          "designer": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
          "restore": {},
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "hook",
              "type": "hook:gateway-webhook",
              "label": "Webhook",
              "required": true
            }
          ],
          "expect": [
            { "name": "event", "type": "text", "label": "Event Type" },
            {
              "name": "whatsappInboundMessage",
              "type": "collection",
              "label": "Inbound Message",
              "spec": [
                { "name": "id", "type": "text", "label": "Message ID" },
                { "name": "from", "type": "text", "label": "From Phone" },
                { "name": "type", "type": "text", "label": "Message Type" },
                {
                  "name": "customerProfile",
                  "type": "collection",
                  "label": "Customer Profile",
                  "spec": [
                    { "name": "name", "type": "text", "label": "Name" }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "name": "text",
                  "type": "collection",
                  "label": "Text Content",
                  "spec": [
                    { "name": "body", "type": "text", "label": "Body" }
                  ]
                },
                { "name": "timestamp", "type": "text", "label": "Timestamp" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "routes": [
          {
            "flow": [
              {
                "id": 2,
                "module": "util:SetVariables",
                "version": 1,
                "parameters": {},
                "mapper": {
                  "variables": [
                    {
                      "name": "celular",
                      "value": "{{1.whatsappInboundMessage.from}}"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "nombre",
                      "value": "{{1.whatsappInboundMessage.customerProfile.name}}"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "mensaje",
                      "value": "{{1.whatsappInboundMessage.text.body}}"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "metadata": {
                  "designer": { "x": 300, "y": 0 },
                  "expect": [
                    {
                      "name": "variables",
                      "type": "array",
                      "label": "Variables",
                      "spec": [
                        { "name": "name", "type": "text", "label": "Variable name", "required": true },
                        { "name": "value", "type": "any", "label": "Variable value" }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 3,
                "module": "google-firebase-firestore:searchDocuments",
                "version": 3,
                "parameters": {},
                "mapper": {
                  "select": "list",
                  "collectionId": "teams/__TEAM_ID__/contacts",
                  "conditions": [
                    [
                      {
                        "fieldPath": "platformId",
                        "op": "EQUAL",
                        "value": "{{2.celular}}"
                      }
                    ]
                  ],
                  "limit": "1"
                },
                "metadata": {
                  "designer": { "x": 600, "y": 0 },
                  "comment": "Busca contacto existente en Firebase por numero de WhatsApp",
                  "parameters": [
                    {
                      "name": "connection",
                      "type": "account:google-firebase",
                      "label": "Firebase Connection",
                      "required": true
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 4,
                "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
                "version": 1,
                "mapper": {},
                "metadata": {
                  "designer": { "x": 900, "y": 0 }
                },
                "routes": [
                  {
                    "label": "Contacto nuevo",
                    "filter": {
                      "name": "Contacto NO encontrado",
                      "conditions": [
                        [
                          {
                            "a": "{{length(3)}}",
                            "b": "0",
                            "o": "number:equal"
                          }
                        ]
                      ]
                    },
                    "flow": [
                      {
                        "id": 5,
                        "module": "google-firebase-firestore:addDocument",
                        "version": 3,
                        "parameters": {},
                        "mapper": {
                          "collectionId": "teams/__TEAM_ID__/contacts",
                          "data": "{\"name\":\"{{2.nombre}}\",\"phone\":\"{{2.celular}}\",\"platform\":\"whatsapp\",\"platformId\":\"{{2.celular}}\",\"tags\":[],\"notes\":\"\",\"teamId\":\"__TEAM_ID__\",\"createdAt\":\"{{now}}\",\"updatedAt\":\"{{now}}\",\"lastMessageAt\":\"{{now}}\"}"
                        },
                        "metadata": {
                          "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": 150 },
                          "comment": "Crea contacto nuevo en Firebase con datos del mensaje de WhatsApp",
                          "parameters": [
                            {
                              "name": "connection",
                              "type": "account:google-firebase",
                              "label": "Firebase Connection",
                              "required": true
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "Contacto existente",
                    "filter": {
                      "name": "Contacto encontrado",
                      "conditions": [
                        [
                          {
                            "a": "{{length(3)}}",
                            "b": "0",
                            "o": "number:notEqual"
                          }
                        ]
                      ]
                    },
                    "flow": [
                      {
                        "id": 6,
                        "module": "google-firebase-firestore:updateDocument",
                        "version": 3,
                        "parameters": {},
                        "mapper": {
                          "documentId": "teams/__TEAM_ID__/contacts/{{3.`__name__`}}",
                          "data": "{\"lastMessageAt\":\"{{now}}\",\"updatedAt\":\"{{now}}\"}"
                        },
                        "metadata": {
                          "designer": { "x": 1200, "y": -150 },
                          "comment": "Actualiza timestamp del contacto existente",
                          "parameters": [
                            {
                              "name": "connection",
                              "type": "account:google-firebase",
                              "label": "Firebase Connection",
                              "required": true
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": 7,
                "module": "google-firebase-firestore:addDocument",
                "version": 3,
                "parameters": {},
                "mapper": {
                  "collectionId": "teams/__TEAM_ID__/conversations",
                  "data": "{\"contactId\":\"{{ifempty(3.`__name__`; 5.`__name__`)}}\",\"teamId\":\"__TEAM_ID__\",\"platform\":\"whatsapp\",\"status\":\"open\",\"aiEnabled\":false,\"unreadCount\":1,\"createdAt\":\"{{now}}\",\"updatedAt\":\"{{now}}\"}"
                },
                "metadata": {
                  "designer": { "x": 1500, "y": 0 },
                  "comment": "Crea nueva conversacion en Firebase",
                  "parameters": [
                    {
                      "name": "connection",
                      "type": "account:google-firebase",
                      "label": "Firebase Connection",
                      "required": true
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 8,
                "module": "google-firebase-firestore:addDocument",
                "version": 3,
                "parameters": {},
                "mapper": {
                  "collectionId": "teams/__TEAM_ID__/messages",
                  "data": "{\"conversationId\":\"{{7.`__name__`}}\",\"contactId\":\"{{ifempty(3.`__name__`; 5.`__name__`)}}\",\"teamId\":\"__TEAM_ID__\",\"direction\":\"inbound\",\"platform\":\"whatsapp\",\"content\":\"{{2.mensaje}}\",\"messageType\":\"text\",\"status\":\"delivered\",\"isAiGenerated\":false,\"createdAt\":\"{{now}}\"}"
                },
                "metadata": {
                  "designer": { "x": 1800, "y": 0 },
                  "comment": "Guarda el mensaje entrante en Firebase",
                  "parameters": [
                    {
                      "name": "connection",
                      "type": "account:google-firebase",
                      "label": "Firebase Connection",
                      "required": true
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 9,
                "module": "google-firebase-firestore:searchDocuments",
                "version": 3,
                "parameters": {},
                "mapper": {
                  "select": "list",
                  "collectionId": "teams/__TEAM_ID__/aiAgents",
                  "conditions": [
                    [
                      {
                        "fieldPath": "isActive",
                        "op": "EQUAL",
                        "value": "true"
                      }
                    ]
                  ],
                  "limit": "1"
                },
                "metadata": {
                  "designer": { "x": 2100, "y": 0 },
                  "comment": "Busca agente de IA activo en Firebase",
                  "parameters": [
                    {
                      "name": "connection",
                      "type": "account:google-firebase",
                      "label": "Firebase Connection",
                      "required": true
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 10,
                "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
                "version": 1,
                "mapper": {},
                "metadata": {
                  "designer": { "x": 2400, "y": 0 }
                },
                "routes": [
                  {
                    "label": "IA responde",
                    "filter": {
                      "name": "Agente IA encontrado",
                      "conditions": [
                        [
                          {
                            "a": "{{length(9)}}",
                            "b": "0",
                            "o": "number:notEqual"
                          }
                        ]
                      ]
                    },
                    "flow": [
                      {
                        "id": 11,
                        "module": "openai:CreateChatCompletion",
                        "version": 1,
                        "parameters": {},
                        "mapper": {
                          "model": "{{9.model}}",
                          "messages": [
                            { "role": "system", "content": "{{9.systemPrompt}}" },
                            { "role": "user", "content": "{{2.mensaje}}" }
                          ],
                          "max_tokens": "{{9.maxTokens}}",
                          "temperature": "{{9.temperature}}"
                        },
                        "metadata": {
                          "designer": { "x": 2700, "y": -150 },
                          "comment": "Genera respuesta con OpenAI usando el system prompt y configuracion del agente",
                          "parameters": [
                            {
                              "name": "connection",
                              "type": "account:openai",
                              "label": "OpenAI Connection",
                              "required": true
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": 12,
                        "module": "http:ActionSendData",
                        "version": 3,
                        "parameters": {},
                        "mapper": {
                          "url": "https://api.ycloud.com/v2/whatsapp/messages",
                          "serializeUrl": false,
                          "method": "POST",
                          "headers": [
                            { "name": "X-API-Key", "value": "__YCLOUD_API_KEY__" },
                            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                          ],
                          "qs": [],
                          "bodyType": "raw",
                          "parseResponse": true,
                          "contentType": "application/json",
                          "body": "{\"from\":\"__PHONE_NUMBER__\",\"to\":\"{{2.celular}}\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":{\"body\":\"{{11.choices[1].message.content}}\"}}"
                        },
                        "metadata": {
                          "designer": { "x": 3000, "y": -150 },
                          "comment": "Envia respuesta de IA al cliente via yCloud WhatsApp API"
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "id": 13,
                        "module": "google-firebase-firestore:addDocument",
                        "version": 3,
                        "parameters": {},
                        "mapper": {
                          "collectionId": "teams/__TEAM_ID__/messages",
                          "data": "{\"conversationId\":\"{{7.`__name__`}}\",\"contactId\":\"{{ifempty(3.`__name__`; 5.`__name__`)}}\",\"teamId\":\"__TEAM_ID__\",\"direction\":\"outbound\",\"platform\":\"whatsapp\",\"content\":\"{{11.choices[1].message.content}}\",\"messageType\":\"text\",\"status\":\"sent\",\"isAiGenerated\":true,\"createdAt\":\"{{now}}\"}"
                        },
                        "metadata": {
                          "designer": { "x": 3300, "y": -150 },
                          "comment": "Guarda la respuesta del agente IA en Firebase",
                          "parameters": [
                            {
                              "name": "connection",
                              "type": "account:google-firebase",
                              "label": "Firebase Connection",
                              "required": true
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "Sin agente IA"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
        "version": 1,
        "parameters": {
          "hook": {
            "label": "CRM Outbound Webhook",
            "type": "hook"
          },
          "maxResults": 1
        },
        "mapper": {},
        "metadata": {
          "designer": { "x": 0, "y": 500 },
          "comment": "Webhook para enviar mensajes desde el CRM al cliente",
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "hook",
              "type": "hook:gateway-webhook",
              "label": "Webhook",
              "required": true
            }
          ],
          "expect": [
            { "name": "to", "type": "text", "label": "Recipient Phone" },
            { "name": "message", "type": "text", "label": "Message Text" },
            { "name": "conversationId", "type": "text", "label": "Conversation ID" },
            { "name": "contactId", "type": "text", "label": "Contact ID" },
            { "name": "teamId", "type": "text", "label": "Team ID" },
            { "name": "messageId", "type": "text", "label": "Message ID" }
          ]
        },
        "routes": [
          {
            "flow": [
              {
                "id": 15,
                "module": "http:ActionSendData",
                "version": 3,
                "parameters": {},
                "mapper": {
                  "url": "https://api.ycloud.com/v2/whatsapp/messages",
                  "serializeUrl": false,
                  "method": "POST",
                  "headers": [
                    { "name": "X-API-Key", "value": "__YCLOUD_API_KEY__" },
                    { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                  ],
                  "qs": [],
                  "bodyType": "raw",
                  "parseResponse": true,
                  "contentType": "application/json",
                  "body": "{\"from\":\"__PHONE_NUMBER__\",\"to\":\"{{14.to}}\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":{\"body\":\"{{14.message}}\"}}"
                },
                "metadata": {
                  "designer": { "x": 300, "y": 500 },
                  "comment": "Envia mensaje del agente humano via yCloud"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 16,
                "module": "google-firebase-firestore:updateDocument",
                "version": 3,
                "parameters": {},
                "mapper": {
                  "documentId": "teams/{{14.teamId}}/messages/{{14.messageId}}",
                  "data": "{\"status\":\"delivered\"}"
                },
                "metadata": {
                  "designer": { "x": 600, "y": 500 },
                  "comment": "Actualiza el status del mensaje a delivered despues de enviar por yCloud",
                  "parameters": [
                    {
                      "name": "connection",
                      "type": "account:google-firebase",
                      "label": "Firebase Connection",
                      "required": true
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
        "version": 1,
        "parameters": {
          "hook": {
            "label": "CRM New Conversation Webhook",
            "type": "hook"
          },
          "maxResults": 1
        },
        "mapper": {},
        "metadata": {
          "designer": { "x": 0, "y": 1000 },
          "comment": "Webhook para iniciar conversaciones nuevas desde el CRM",
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "hook",
              "type": "hook:gateway-webhook",
              "label": "Webhook",
              "required": true
            }
          ],
          "expect": [
            { "name": "to", "type": "text", "label": "Recipient Phone" },
            { "name": "message", "type": "text", "label": "First Message Text" },
            { "name": "contactName", "type": "text", "label": "Contact Name" },
            { "name": "contactId", "type": "text", "label": "Contact ID (if existing)" },
            { "name": "conversationId", "type": "text", "label": "Conversation ID" },
            { "name": "teamId", "type": "text", "label": "Team ID" },
            { "name": "isNewContact", "type": "boolean", "label": "Is New Contact" }
          ]
        },
        "routes": [
          {
            "flow": [
              {
                "id": 18,
                "module": "http:ActionSendData",
                "version": 3,
                "parameters": {},
                "mapper": {
                  "url": "https://api.ycloud.com/v2/whatsapp/messages",
                  "serializeUrl": false,
                  "method": "POST",
                  "headers": [
                    { "name": "X-API-Key", "value": "__YCLOUD_API_KEY__" },
                    { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                  ],
                  "qs": [],
                  "bodyType": "raw",
                  "parseResponse": true,
                  "contentType": "application/json",
                  "body": "{\"from\":\"__PHONE_NUMBER__\",\"to\":\"{{17.to}}\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":{\"body\":\"{{17.message}}\"}}"
                },
                "metadata": {
                  "designer": { "x": 300, "y": 1000 },
                  "comment": "Envia el primer mensaje via yCloud WhatsApp API"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 19,
                "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
                "version": 1,
                "mapper": {},
                "metadata": {
                  "designer": { "x": 600, "y": 1000 }
                },
                "routes": [
                  {
                    "label": "Mensaje enviado OK",
                    "filter": {
                      "name": "yCloud respondio OK",
                      "conditions": [
                        [
                          {
                            "a": "{{18.statusCode}}",
                            "b": "200",
                            "o": "number:equal"
                          }
                        ]
                      ]
                    },
                    "flow": [
                      {
                        "id": 20,
                        "module": "google-firebase-firestore:updateDocument",
                        "version": 3,
                        "parameters": {},
                        "mapper": {
                          "documentId": "teams/{{17.teamId}}/conversations/{{17.conversationId}}",
                          "data": "{\"updatedAt\":\"{{now}}\"}"
                        },
                        "metadata": {
                          "designer": { "x": 900, "y": 900 },
                          "comment": "Actualiza timestamp de la conversacion despues de enviar exitosamente",
                          "parameters": [
                            {
                              "name": "connection",
                              "type": "account:google-firebase",
                              "label": "Firebase Connection",
                              "required": true
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "Mensaje fallo",
                    "filter": {
                      "name": "Error de yCloud",
                      "conditions": [
                        [
                          {
                            "a": "{{18.statusCode}}",
                            "b": "200",
                            "o": "number:notEqual"
                          }
                        ]
                      ]
                    },
                    "flow": [
                      {
                        "id": 21,
                        "module": "google-firebase-firestore:addDocument",
                        "version": 3,
                        "parameters": {},
                        "mapper": {
                          "collectionId": "teams/{{17.teamId}}/messages",
                          "data": "{\"conversationId\":\"{{17.conversationId}}\",\"contactId\":\"{{17.contactId}}\",\"teamId\":\"{{17.teamId}}\",\"direction\":\"outbound\",\"platform\":\"whatsapp\",\"content\":\"Error: No se pudo enviar el mensaje. Verifica el numero de telefono.\",\"messageType\":\"text\",\"status\":\"failed\",\"isAiGenerated\":false,\"createdAt\":\"{{now}}\",\"metadata\":{\"errorCode\":\"{{18.statusCode}}\",\"errorBody\":\"{{18.body}}\"}}"
                        },
                        "metadata": {
                          "designer": { "x": 900, "y": 1100 },
                          "comment": "Registra mensaje de error en Firebase cuando falla el envio",
                          "parameters": [
                            {
                              "name": "connection",
                              "type": "account:google-firebase",
                              "label": "Firebase Connection",
                              "required": true
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "readme": "## MessageHub - yCloud WhatsApp Integration\n\n### Estructura del escenario:\n\n#### Flujo 1: Inbound (yCloud -> Firebase) - Modulos 1-13\n```\n[1] Webhook yCloud -> [2] Set Variables (celular, nombre, mensaje) ->\n[3] Buscar contacto -> [4] Router ->\n  -> [5] Crear contacto nuevo\n  -> [6] Actualizar contacto existente\n-> [7] Crear conversacion -> [8] Guardar mensaje ->\n[9] Buscar agente IA -> [10] Router ->\n  -> [11] OpenAI -> [12] Enviar respuesta yCloud -> [13] Guardar respuesta IA\n  -> Sin agente (fin)\n```\n\n#### Flujo 2: Outbound (CRM -> yCloud) - Modulos 14-16\n```\n[14] Webhook CRM -> [15] Enviar por yCloud -> [16] Actualizar status mensaje\n```\n\n#### Flujo 3: Nueva Conversacion (CRM -> yCloud) - Modulos 17-21\n```\n[17] Webhook nueva conversacion -> [18] Enviar primer mensaje yCloud -> [19] Router ->\n  -> [20] OK: Actualizar conversacion\n  -> [21] Error: Registrar error en Firebase\n```\n\n### Variables del modulo 2 (Set Multiple Variables):\n- **celular**: {{1.whatsappInboundMessage.from}} - Numero de WhatsApp del remitente\n- **nombre**: {{1.whatsappInboundMessage.customerProfile.name}} - Nombre del contacto\n- **mensaje**: {{1.whatsappInboundMessage.text.body}} - Contenido del mensaje\n\n### Para importar en Make.com:\n1. Ve a Scenarios > Import Blueprint\n2. Sube este archivo JSON\n3. Reemplaza los placeholders:\n   - __TEAM_ID__ -> Tu Team ID de Firebase\n   - __YCLOUD_API_KEY__ -> Tu API Key de yCloud\n   - __PHONE_NUMBER__ -> Tu numero de WhatsApp en yCloud\n4. Configura las conexiones de Firebase y OpenAI\n5. Activa el escenario\n\n### Configuracion de yCloud:\n1. En yCloud Dashboard, configura un webhook apuntando al Webhook #1 de Make\n2. Selecciona eventos: whatsapp.inbound_message.received\n3. Copia tu API Key para usarla en __YCLOUD_API_KEY__\n4. Registra tu numero de WhatsApp Business en yCloud"
}
